      "key": "greeting",
      "theme": "white",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:44px 48px 32px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">\n        <p contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Hey {{contact.first_name}},\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--heading);margin-bottom:16px;\" class=\"\">Hey {{contact.first_name}},</p>\n        <div class=\"li-list\" data-proto=\"&lt;table class=&quot;li-wrap&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;\n        &lt;td valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;p contenteditable=&quot;true&quot; data-ph=&quot;New paragraph&quot; style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:var(--body-text);line-height:1.85;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n        &lt;td class=&quot;li-ctrls&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;width:0;font-size:0;line-height:0;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;li-move up&quot; onclick=&quot;moveLi(this,-1)&quot; title=&quot;Move up&quot;&gt;▲&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;li-move dn&quot; onclick=&quot;moveLi(this,1)&quot; title=&quot;Move down&quot;&gt;▼&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;li-del&quot; onclick=&quot;delLi(this)&quot;&gt;×&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n      &lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;\" style=\"\" data-pkeys=\"1\"><table class=\"li-wrap\" role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;position:relative;\"><tbody><tr>\n        <td valign=\"top\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"You've been a member for 30 days — your first real milestone. We want to celebrate it the right way. Not with a certificate. With data.\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--body-text);line-height:1.85;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:14px;\" class=\"\">You did it. Thirty days. Countless good decisions. Moments when you wanted to quit but didn't. Moments when you chose progress over perfections. And now you're here.<br>​</p></td>\n        <td class=\"li-ctrls\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:0;font-size:0;line-height:0;white-space:nowrap;\"><button class=\"li-move up\" onclick=\"moveLi(this,-1)\" title=\"Move up\">▲</button><button class=\"li-move dn\" onclick=\"moveLi(this,1)\" title=\"Move down\">▼</button><button class=\"li-del\" onclick=\"delLi(this)\">×</button></td>\n      </tr></tbody></table><table class=\"li-wrap\" role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;position:relative;\"><tbody><tr>\n        <td valign=\"top\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"New paragraph\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--body-text);line-height:1.85;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:14px;\" class=\"\">You did what 92% of people who set goals never do, you finished. No matter what the scale says, take a moment to celebrate. You've proven something important: you can do hard things.<br>​</p></td>\n        <td class=\"li-ctrls\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:0;font-size:0;line-height:0;white-space:nowrap;\"><button class=\"li-move up\" onclick=\"moveLi(this,-1)\" title=\"Move up\">▲</button><button class=\"li-move dn\" onclick=\"moveLi(this,1)\" title=\"Move down\">▼</button><button class=\"li-del\" onclick=\"delLi(this)\">×</button></td>\n      </tr></tbody></table><table class=\"li-wrap\" role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;position:relative;\"><tbody><tr>\n        <td valign=\"top\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"New paragraph\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--body-text);line-height:1.85;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:14px;\" class=\"\">Today is for celebrating genuinely. Post in the WhatsApp group. Share your win. Tell someone in your life what you did. You earned this;'</p></td>\n        <td class=\"li-ctrls\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:0;font-size:0;line-height:0;white-space:nowrap;\"><button class=\"li-move up\" onclick=\"moveLi(this,-1)\" title=\"Move up\">▲</button><button class=\"li-move dn\" onclick=\"moveLi(this,1)\" title=\"Move down\">▼</button><button class=\"li-del\" onclick=\"delLi(this)\">×</button></td>\n      </tr></tbody></table></div>\n    <button class=\"li-add\" onclick=\"addLi(this)\">+ Add paragraph</button>\n      </div>\n    "
