    {
      "key": "chQuote",
      "theme": "white",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:46px 48px;text-align:center;\">\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"“Don’t cry because it’s over, smile because it happened.”\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--heading);font-style:italic;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;\" class=\"\">The healthiest version of you isn't something you achieve. It's something you continue becoming.</div>\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"And then do it again.\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-top:18px;\" class=\"\">So what's the next chapter?</div>\n      <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;padding-top:24px;margin-top:30px;text-align:left;\">\n        <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Yours in health,\" style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#888888;font-weight:300;\" class=\"\">Congratulations - We're proud of you.</div>\n        <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Tim Pedersen\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:16px;color:var(--heading);margin-top:6px;\" class=\"\">Tim</div>\n        <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"LNGVTY Hub\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-top:2px;\" class=\"\">LNGVTY HUB</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    "
